{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To pay for a loved one's medical bills, you became a thief, living a life of theft. Your partner told you about a potentially valuable treasure in a haunted mansion out in the wilderness, rekindling your hope... But upon entering the mansion, you find it has been taken over by a creepy little girl in red. On her turf, you'd better obey her and play along with her games... or else...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get in, make a grand, get out. That's the plan.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089820/extras/9c10cf07b50baba6181aa3de0c041823.poster.avif?t=1761829928\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089820/extras/9c10cf07b50baba6181aa3de0c041823.webm?t=1761829928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089820/extras/9c10cf07b50baba6181aa3de0c041823.mp4?t=1761829928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a professional thief, loot everything of value.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use your wits to solve the puzzle.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089820/extras/976e14970274345f8bcf3a4caf4b23e4.poster.avif?t=1761829928\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089820/extras/976e14970274345f8bcf3a4caf4b23e4.webm?t=1761829928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089820/extras/976e14970274345f8bcf3a4caf4b23e4.mp4?t=1761829928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >All kinds of eerie events a